    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29158" root="عسى" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالعَسَى أَنْ تَفْعَلَ</span></b>  means <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالحَرَى</span> [i. e. <i>It is suitable, fit,</i> or <i>proper, that thou shouldst do</i> such a
thing]. (K. [In the CK, and likewise in the
TK, erroneously, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بالعَسِىِّ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بالحَرِىِّ</span>.]) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَسًا</span>:
see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عسو</span>.

